From: Carlos Augusto <mb@lab.how>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 21:13:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in output-token budget clamping

Port of lineage patch 001 (tip commit cf8193372e) onto karmic-kraken-beta.
clamp_max_tokens=true on chat/completion requests removes the output
reservation from the renderer input cap so the serving layer clamps the
output budget to remaining context headroom instead of rejecting the
request; the prompt is kept whole.

kk drift: chat protocol moved from entrypoints/openai/chat/ to
entrypoints/openai/chat_completion/; hunks re-anchored by hand.
Completion protocol applies cleanly. Test ported unchanged (get_max_tokens
lives at the same path in both trees).
